      "name": "Fresh Content Backport",
      "slug": "fresh-content-backport",
      "teaser": "A mod aimed at adding content to SPT 3.11 that can be transferred painlessly from the latest EFT updates.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2890.jpg",
      "downloads": 7040,
      "favourites_count": 0,
      "description": "<p><strong>Disclaimer: You install this mod at your own risk.</strong></p>\n<p>Requires <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/885-virtual-s-custom-quest-loader/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Virtual’s Custom Quest Loader</a> as a dependency.</p>\n<p>This mod in SPT 3.11 adds the following content:</p>\n<p>1. The F-1 grenade with a reduced delay is sold by a Jaeger at the first loyalty level.</p>\n<p>2. Keys case, available for purchase and exchange from the Ref and Therapist.</p>\n<p>3. New crafts in the intelligence center and nutrition unit.</p>\n<p>4. Body armor and chest rigs from the Battle Pass Season 0.</p>\n<p>Supports English and Russian languages</p>\n",
